情。」曰：「中國無事，秦得燒掇焚杅君之國；有事，秦將輕使重幣事君之國。」其後五國伐秦。會陳軫謂秦王曰：「義渠君者，蠻夷之賢君也，不如賂之以撫其志。」秦王曰：「善。」乃以文繡千純，婦女百人遺義渠君。義渠君致群臣而謀曰：「此公孫衍所謂邪？」乃起兵襲秦，大敗秦人李伯之下。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"義渠君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004139","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004129","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"張儀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004084","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"犀首","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004129","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"義渠君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004139","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004139","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"陳軫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004104","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004140","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"義渠君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004139","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004140","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0128","start":128,"end":132,"surface":"婦女百人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、比擬或未定指代，不補姓名、家屬或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-070-zhang:m057-0133","start":133,"end":136,"surface":"義渠君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004139","statu